{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門發生襲擊案。今日（12日）上午8時46分，警方接報屯門杯渡路近港鐵屯門站對開，一名男子突然走出路中，打開一輛新界的士的車門，並毆打司機。警</p><p>警方及救援人員到場，遇襲司機沒有受傷，初步調查懷疑該名涉事男子精神紊亂，正進一步調查其身分及動機，案件列襲擊案。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130807901179744256719052.jpeg/l3zJ_TtzY9qY9lIqJMalZbarTLNGuX1HHocEFh6HBBY\" alt=\"警員正向涉案男子了解事件。（Facebook 屯門友圖片）\"><figcaption>警員正向涉案男子了解事件。（Facebook 屯門友圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130807898998575104419068.jpeg/4ovj0zQmc3ZTJG6gsNe5WrGOt_Q-BJ5A0yKx59Misec\" alt=\"一名男子懷疑強行開車門毆打司機。（Facebook Joe Chan圖片）\"><figcaption>一名男子懷疑強行開車門毆打司機。（Facebook Joe Chan圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130807896649633792208395.jpeg/GNjM8L5OXLAYNIeVqZR8JsI43xKWxpWfwMGCrMDBgqw\" alt=\"警員到場調查。（Facebook Joe Chan圖片）\"><figcaption>警員到場調查。（Facebook Joe Chan圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130807893822541824832791.jpeg/tLX-tz9YLfgqK5k6G4vYt6D8HjHy6_L2H_QN4B_0DeA\" alt=\"警員到場調查。（Facebook 屯門友圖片）\"><figcaption>警員到場調查。（Facebook 屯門友圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T04:19:21.579753+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}